c42c331c3ede8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762201925","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/001ebac30a2b1c90a0117a6c9e0c42c331c3ede8/ss_001ebac30a2b1c90a0117a6c9e0c42c331c3ede8.600x338.jpg?t=1762201925"}],"short_description":"Awaken as a fragmented soul in a first-person, psychological horror nightmare. With minimal hand-holding, evade the relentless Shepherd and wield the Spirit Catcher to survive. Inspired by classic, difficult games, uncover the terrifying truth of this fractured realm.","steam_appid":4128630,"support_info":{"email":"support@apexstudios.uk","url":"https://apexstudios.uk/contact-us/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://apexstudios.uk/"}